<mj-text font-size="18px" font-weight="bold">
  New Login Detected
</mj-text>

<mj-text>
  Hi {{name}},
</mj-text>

<mj-text>
  A new login to your account was detected:
</mj-text>

<mj-text>
  <strong>Device:</strong> {{deviceName}}<br/>
  <strong>Browser:</strong> {{userAgent}}<br/>
  <strong>Time:</strong> {{lastLoginAt}}
</mj-text>

<mj-text>
  If this was you, no action is required.
</mj-text>

<mj-text>
  If not, we strongly recommend logging out of all devices:
</mj-text>

<mj-button background-color="#d93025" href="{{logoutUrl}}">
  Logout All Devices
</mj-button>

<mj-text font-size="12px" color="#777">
  This will immediately sign you out everywhere.
</mj-text>
